  "details": "Description\n\nWith big menu open, players can playspace drag through colliders and their nameplate/pill stays in place. This can be used to troll and avoid moderation.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nOpen big menu, with it open, playspace drag through collider. Avatar body will follow.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
